    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007) & Cartwright et al. (2009) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target terraces, defect pair annihilation, chitin-membrane perforation bridges and aragonite twin polygonization — Morphometric validation: 80/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1666-1835) now returns 15 reference-anchored measurements, and the Pass 3 ones are honest: raw spiral pitch 7.8007 vs 7.9736 um (L1715-1722, blend removed), columnar offset 0.000 vs 0 (L1775-1783), sheet offset 0.215 vs nominal 0.5 with the under-prediction stated (L1785-1793), sweep transition 0.125 vs the model-analytic 0.121 (L1795-1803), f_2/f_6 vs analytic (L1805-1823), twin angle parity (L1825-1833), and the SEM h_0 method string now carries the calibration caveat (L1748). Deductions: measurements 1-3 (L1684-1713) regress against a 12-species table whose lambda_obs/omega_obs are within ~1 % of the BCF law for every species and are untraceable to any measured table, so r = 0.9999 is circular (-8); measurements 7-9 depend on a calibration anchored to the reference value, only CV and aspect ratio being calibration-independent (-4); measurements 13-14 reproduce the analytic f_2/f_6 to 4 digits because T^-1 is nearly linear at the measured ring, validating the implementation more than the physics (-3); measurement 12's reference is the model's own analytic threshold (-2); the sheet-mode offset misses the nominal 0.5 by 2.7 SD (-3); no morphometric compares the model to a literature bridge-offset or tablet-polygonality measurement (e.g. Checa et al. 2011) (-3). Offsetting credit for the honest 2 % raw-pitch deficit and field-counted terrace numbers (7/6/13 vs refs 6/6/12)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "datasets/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces_reference.json L78–L89: 12-species lambda_obs_um / omega_obs_rad_hr within ~1 % of lambda_pred for every species; not traceable to a measured table <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e651a8b8/datasets/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces/nacre_spiral_dislocation_terraces_reference.json#L78-L89>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-12-species-bcf-spiral-terrace-pitch-correlation-cartwright-checa-2007-bcf-1951>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-12-species-spiral-angular-rotation-frequency-correlation-omega-omega-0-v-inf-r-c>,
