            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-bivalve-sheet-nacre-pteria-hirundo-brick-wall-mineral-bridge-stacking-offset-d-tab-from-random-pore-membrane-perforation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-bivalve-sheet-nacre-pteria-hirundo-single-spiral-terrace-pitch-lambda-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-columnar-gastropod-nacre-haliotis-rufescens-mineral-bridge-stacking-offset-c-k-c-k-1-d-tab-from-stacked-sheet-allen-cahn-membrane-perforation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-columnar-to-sheet-stacking-transition-bridge-localisation-sigma-d-tab-at-which-the-mean-offset-first-exceeds-0-1-d-tab>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-empirical-bcf-terrace-pitch-to-critical-radius-slope-lambda-0-r-c>,
